# Getting Started with {{ stack_name }}

This tutorial walks through spinning up `{{ stack_name }}` in local development.

## Steps

1. Copy `.env.example` to `.env`.
2. Inspect `SERVICE_HTTP_PORT` (defaults to `{{ service_http_port }}`).
3. Launch with `docker compose up -d`.
4. Validate service health at `http://localhost:{{ service_http_port }}`.
